        <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="some badges remain and the number is enough" data-hint="A few means a small count above zero; the rest of the line says it is enough." data-fix="A few extra badges remain, and the line says the number is enough."><p class="quiz-question">4. What does <span class="ex">a few extra badges</span> mean in Clip 4?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="some badges remain and the number is enough">some badges remain and the number is enough</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="no badges remain">no badges remain</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="the badge count passes a limit">the badge count passes a limit</button></div></div>
