        <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="two separate coffee servings" data-hint="At a café counter, plural coffees means separate servings or cups." data-fix="Two coffees are ready means two separate coffee servings are ready."><p class="quiz-question">6. What does <span class="ex">two coffees</span> mean in Clip 6?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="two separate coffee servings">two separate coffee servings</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="two types of event furniture">two types of event furniture</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="an unmeasured amount of coffee">an unmeasured amount of coffee</button></div></div>
