      <summary>Open the teacher script after checking</summary>
      <ol>
        <li><span class="ex">How many chairs are ready?</span></li>
        <li><span class="ex">How much water do we have?</span></li>
        <li><span class="ex">The guide contains a lot of information.</span></li>
